# Caddyfile — CLOUDFLARE TUNNEL MODE (Zero Trust)
# Alternative: use Cloudflare Tunnel for secure external access without opening ports
# Requires: cloudflared CLI installed and authenticated
# Usage: cloudflared tunnel --config cloudflared.yml run
#
# This Caddyfile would be minimalist if using Tunnel (tunnel handles HTTPS).
# Instead, run tunneled daemon and keep Express on localhost only.
# See: https://developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-one/connections/connect-apps/install-and-setup/tunnel-guide/
